From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jorge Trigger <lordchronotrigger@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:01:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gfx: release program and specialization caches on teardown

The last lookup and last draw retain shader programs independently of the
serial table. Release those owners and their cache keys after work drains,
along with the independent positive and negative border-specialization map.
Two-session Metal tests fail before the change and verify release, serial
reuse and rendered pixels after it. This does not establish the cause of
the iPad kernel wait, and has not changed the installed diagnostic candidate.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Release independently retained program and shader owners before a shell session reset
Issue: seedds/nxnative#2098 (related hang only, causality unproven)
